  </section>

  <section class="id-sources id-section" aria-labelledby="src-h2">
    <h2 id="src-h2">Sources</h2>
    <ol class="id-src-list">
      <li id="src-1">Reid, B. &amp; Bringhurst, R. (1984). <em>The Raven Steals the Light</em>. Douglas &amp; McIntyre. — Haida Raven stories retold with Haida storyteller involvement; note: a retelling, not a primary traditional text.</li>
      <li id="src-2">Sax, B. (2007). <em>Crow</em>. Reaktion Books. — survey of Raven in Pacific Northwest and sub-Arctic traditions with academic framing.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="id-claim-note"><strong class="claim-lore">[lore]</strong> named secondary sources; primary sources belong to specific nations</p>
  </section>

